#: ../call.cpp:194
msgid "Received incoming call, but calls are not supported"
msgstr "Eingehender Anruf, aber nicht unterstützt"

#. TRANSLATOR: Dialog content, user will have the options "_OK" and "_Cancel".
#: ../call.cpp:208
#, c++-format
